    "notes": {
        "caa98a2d-35a1-4083-a5f1-bb907c1d75a1": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 912,
            "width": 760,
            "height": 360,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data: one prepared Telegram contact\n\nThis flow does not create contacts. It finds the contact whose Text custom field **appmixer_e2e** is **e2e-contact**.\nOne-time setup on the Manychat test account:\n\n1. Settings → Channels → connect Telegram with the bot **@AppmixerManychatBot** (token in appmixer-test-credentials).\n2. Settings → Fields → New User Field: name **appmixer_e2e**, type **Text**.\n3. In Telegram, open @AppmixerManychatBot and press Start. In Manychat → Contacts open that contact and set **appmixer_e2e** = **e2e-contact**.\n\nTelegram has no 24-hour messaging window, so the contact keeps working without re-messaging.\n4. Automation → New Flow named exactly **Appmixer E2E**, with one Telegram Send Message step, published."
        }
    }
